creatures:
- name: Nalfeshnee
  statblock:
    custom_statblock: |
      **Armor Class** 18  
      **Hit Points** 184 (rollable(dice=16d10 + 96,dicelabel=Hit Points))  
      **Speed** Walk 20 ft., Fly 30 ft.  
      **Initiative:** rollable(dice=1d20+5,label=+5,dicelabel=Initiative) (15)

      ---

      |||Mod|Save|||Mod|Save|
      |---:|:---:|:---:|:---:|---:|:---:|:---:|:---:|
